{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "38b94fb1-c9e2-52d4-bf8e-1dbb17b55566", "source_ordinal": 2035, "reading_ordinal": 2021, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "吹哨人", "published_at": "2023-09-04T14:03:24+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/619869697/answer/3196458897"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "“正常”和“不对”并不是互相矛盾的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "不要一听“正常”，就立刻松一口气，觉得这就是对的了。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "正常人大多数都是不成功的，是惊恐的、不安的、孤独的，是勉强的、挣扎的。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你不能在“把一切正常等同于正确”的前提下寻求和正常人不同的结果，这是显而易见的逻辑不成立的——配方一样，味道当然相同。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个认识要牢牢牢牢牢牢的烙在脑子里。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这意味着即使你不是处处求超常，至少也要在大部分正常的前提下在尽可能多的方面求超常，这是争取超出一般水平得到幸福平安这种罕见结果的逻辑必要条件。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 234}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你肯定要在某些方面作出一些“这很正常，但是错的”的判断。", "char_start": 235, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这样你才有不一样的配方，有获得不一样的味道的可能。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "可以这么说，世间“正常”的事，并没有哪一件可以说是“无懈可击的正确”的，在绝对意义上都是错的——这也是为什么我的更新可以永无穷尽。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但你是有限的动物，所以客观上大部分情况下你都最好采取节能模式，满足（settle）于“正常”选项。你不能什么都追求超常，那样你体力脑力都办不到。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但是，你在所有自己暂时接受的方面，都应该有一个意识——其实这是能力有限、止步于此，不是它就是“正确”的。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "它当然是错的，只是错得不优先、不关键，所以我暂时不在上面投资源去改进，如此而已。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所有的都是错的，你也就不会对有人指出“你的某某选择存在问题”大惊小怪甚至要去横眉立目了。讳疾忌医的问题会大幅减少。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你也会对“大把的错误结合起来一样可以成事”有足够多的经验，自然就更不容易讳疾忌医。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "说完了这个问题，再说这个“揭发我”的问题。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "当然，“没看到你出过问题”在老板眼里是值钱的，但“不出低级问题，出了也只会出一次”也是值钱的——甚至更值钱。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这位同事揭发了你的低级错误，“不出问题”奖你是拿不到了，但是你也因此获得了“只出一次”奖的参选资格。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 750}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个奖反而更大。", "char_start": 751, "char_end": 759}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "因为前一种奖你迟早是要失去的，落花流水不容留，你能争的其实始终都只有后一种奖。", "char_start": 760, "char_end": 799}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "但这个奖有个潜规则——如果老板发现你在惩罚帮你报名的同事，那你的候选资格就被取消了——因为现在更严重的问题已经不再是这个已知的错误你会不会犯第二次的问题了，而是你看上去没拉响警报的工作靠不靠得住的问题。", "char_start": 800, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "犯错 -1，不隐瞒 +0.8，不重犯 +10；", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 925}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "犯错 -1，隐瞒/报复报告人 -10，取消“不重犯”的考察资格。", "char_start": 926, "char_end": 958}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你算清楚得失，要走哪条路，选好。", "char_start": 959, "char_end": 975}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：同事把我的工作失误告诉领导，我因此内心埋怨、厌恶她，这种心态正常吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“吹哨人”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：““正常”和“不对”并不是互相矛盾的关系。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "“正常”和“不对”并不是互相矛盾的关系。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ccd03479-fd90-5640-9b97-4aa9d861d783", "source_ordinal": 2034, "reading_ordinal": 2022, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "手刹", "published_at": "2023-09-04T18:32:04+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/620383379/answer/3196864049"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "自欺欺人这种事是有自我恶化的倾向的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一旦你锚定了一个背离事实的结论，无论如何也不能改变你自己的立场，这个执着就会逼着你像要掩饰谎言的人那样，一个接一个的对自己撒谎。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这些谎言很多都是违背基本物理规律、社会规律的，旁人凭常识就能一眼看穿，但是你本人因为立场已经站死了、不容转弯回旋了，你自然也就会因为要坚持这些东西，渐渐的脱离基本物理定律、社会规律，做出很多旁人看见就会魂飞魄散的神奇决策来。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这些决策，旁人不论什么政治立场都会觉得你前景不妙，眼见得你要破产、要炸锅，ta们哪怕仅仅为了自保，就会离你远去。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "尤其是你自己一天比一天暴躁、焦虑，ta们嘴上说得客气，脚下却跑得越快。ta们越是远离，你却会越发狂躁、焦虑、荒唐；你越狂躁、焦虑、荒唐，ta们走得越快。这种恶性循环正反馈机制，就像超新星爆炸一样，发生之快往往超乎你的想象。昨天还歌舞升平，两三个月就曲终人散。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 383}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "那个时候自己的事业也因为这一系列荒谬的决定走入绝境，人际关系也因此众叛亲离，那是真的可能发生活生生的饿死这种事的。", "char_start": 384, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这也是为什么我一再的强调客观度量、中性表述、实事求是、旷野生存这些关键问题，一再的力主你们要有怀疑的技术。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个怀疑的技术首先要怀疑的不是别人的结论，而是你自己的结论。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而你的结论一定要尽可能表达得可以有实验证实或证伪的余地——人你可以不信，实验你总要信吧？", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 571}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "只要一个人的主要观点可以拿出一系列的实验来证实，这个人就很不容易出现众叛亲离的问题——因为旁人可以在这些实验证明上寄托信心，自然不会对你作出过于悲观的预期。", "char_start": 572, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "但你如果表达的全是诗化、意境化的、没有刻度的语言，你自己想要检验也就无从检验起，你就会给自己留下极大的自我想象正确的空间。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 712}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这种“看着都不保险”的诅咒就会开始生效，“离弃 - 焦虑”的循环就会开始运转，你会像停在斜坡却没有拉手刹的车一样开始加速向下，直奔悬崖。", "char_start": 713, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那是可能活活饿死的风险。", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 794}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待2023年8月，大象公会员工Akid (王懿) 在日本死于饥饿？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“手刹”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“自欺欺人这种事是有自我恶化的倾向的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "自欺欺人这种事是有自我恶化的倾向的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0cf30a53-cb75-5ca5-b901-c2b12348f21c", "source_ordinal": 2033, "reading_ordinal": 2023, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "枣树", "published_at": "2023-09-05T02:42:49+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/612863260/answer/3197308734"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为父母常在一种恐惧之中。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "ta们很轻易就能看到你离“能令人放心的独立求生的水准”还差得很远，所以很怕你满足于现在的水平，不懂得珍惜时间、抓紧机会、囤积粮草。", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "ta们这个判断当然是错的。ta们应该认识到，你们还有很多时间，不见得到时候一定来不及越过及格线。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "也应该清醒的认识到，其实ta们对“能令人放心的独立求生”的具体标准是非常模糊的，往往本身就高到非常人所能及。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "还应该认识到，世界实际上是仁慈的，对人并没有传闻中、想象中那么苛刻，实际上容得下很多错误和荒唐的人磕磕绊绊的生活下去。", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这些认知是错的，但ta们因为种种原因，并不敢赌。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "而没有这样的乐观支撑，ta们自己就生活在“害怕明天就会失业”“不知道得了重病这个家要如何维持下去”的恒久的焦虑之中。ta们自己就没有达到“能令人放心的独立求生”的及格线，于是也不知道这根线到底有多高。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "于是这事就反向的锁死了——因为信不了，所以乐观不了；因为乐观不了，所以自己不知道如何才能放心的独立生活；因为不知道终点线在哪里，所以对任何具体的成绩——尤其是初级的、显然不足以解决大问题的成绩就宽容不了、认可不了。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 477}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "基本上，ta们是自己在挣扎着把头探出水面，托住你小小的身子，希望你在ta们耗尽力气或者被暗流卷走之前能学会ta们觉得自己没能学会的游泳能力。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "或者更过分，希望你们偶尔也能自己扑腾几下，让ta们能腾出一只手，把自己浮出水面长长的喘几口气。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "ta们都快要撑不住了，所以不切实际的期盼你明天就展现出天纵之才，好腾出手去好歹睡几个好觉，吃几顿香饭，喘息几天。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 653}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，在这种沉浮咳呛之中，ta们很难做到微笑接受你在刚学会了摆姿势或者刚学会佩戴游泳帽时就深感满意，认为应该被授予认可和赞颂——尤其是用一种“不给认可我就不要接着学游泳了”的姿态来索取这种认可和赞颂。", "char_start": 654, "char_end": 754}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这就是ta们在面对你的成绩和期盼赞赏的姿态时的心态。", "char_start": 755, "char_end": 781}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个心态当然是错的，遗憾的是，ta们中的大多数人没有能从十几岁开始就得到这几千篇答案日复一日的支撑、引导和提醒，没有这份幸运在你们到来之前获得对人生全局、世界全局的基本信心。", "char_start": 782, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这是一份漫长的水磨功夫，是一点一滴浇筑起来的，要一步一岗，与无数的乔装改扮的恶魔经年累月、逐门逐户的争夺，而且要不断的胜利。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 932}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "没有这份胜而又胜的经历，到了子女要过这一关的时候，人就会以一种“自己都还没学会游泳、也不知道要如何学得会的挣扎者”的身份来陪着子女过关。", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 1001}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而这个状态下的父母，是没有能力来给予必要的肯定的。", "char_start": 1002, "char_end": 1027}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而在另一方面，对于你们自己，也应该问这样一个问题——父母的肯定真的有那么重要吗？", "char_start": 1028, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "一个微妙的事实是——如果父母是破不了心障、无法坦然的肯定的父母，那么ta们的肯定和否定就同时在客观上缺乏效力了。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1125}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为ta们是因为自己没有找到答案，才导致ta们不敢肯定任何答案的。", "char_start": 1126, "char_end": 1159}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "不知道答案的人的赞同或者不赞同，不应该引起那么大的执着和渴望。", "char_start": 1160, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你需要的其实从来不是父母的赞同，甚至不是老师、同学、大众舆论的赞同。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你需要的是秒表、磅秤、跨栏、转速表、电压表、温度计、显微镜、双盲实验的赞同。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1265}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "人是无知的动物，其实是没资格担保你的成功或者失败的。", "char_start": 1266, "char_end": 1292}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "ta们看好你，并不意味着你是对的、你所要做的事一定成功；不看好你，也并不意味着你就是错的，你所追求的事就不会发生。", "char_start": 1293, "char_end": 1350}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "与其孜孜以求某人某群的赞扬肯定，以至于为没有而沮丧、抱怨，不如及早看破这种需求的虚妄，淡然处之。", "char_start": 1351, "char_end": 1399}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "可叹的是，恰恰往往是后一种不在意的人，从不缺乏肯定和赞叹。", "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 1429}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "因为这种“不在意虚名，只在乎实际”的态度，恰恰正是能打消父母焦虑、让ta们忍不住要赞叹的东西，远胜于你刚学会的乘法表和刚背下的唐诗。", "char_start": 1430, "char_end": 1496}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "所以，就算你要得到肯定和赞扬，你也摇错了枣树。", "char_start": 1497, "char_end": 1520}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么大人都喜欢贬低自己的孩子?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“枣树”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为父母常在一种恐惧之中。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为父母常在一种恐惧之中。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 13, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e55c13c6-d573-5c7e-8925-8c1a77d0e65e", "source_ordinal": 2032, "reading_ordinal": 2024, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "殴打信使", "published_at": "2023-09-05T13:55:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/428413851/answer/3197938092"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个无解的时代问题，抱怨也没有多大用，抱怨发泄完了，后面还是要自己拉下面子求加回的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个问题的大背景，其实是中国自己处在一个奋勇追赶的时代，一切都处在“一万年太久，只争朝夕”的状态下。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这说的是一切，一切的一切——没有任何一个行业、一个领域，在中国是被视为“可以悠闲一点，随遇而安一点”的。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 147}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "无论是工农兵学商，我们参与的是全面的竞争，而且处在一个“不胜即死”的危险规则之下。别人输了，还可以指望做个面团团小康之乡，我们输了，以我们的体量和能量，对手不把我们肢解致残，是不能安睡的。", "char_start": 148, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "在“不胜即死”的规则之下，如果胜利无望，那么自然也会有人能顺其自然，娱乐至死，问题是我们卧薪尝胆七十年——不，是两百年——现在正在历史上最强盛的时期。你作为第二名，每一步都都踢到第一名的屁股了，而你如果输了就会死，你能放弃得了吗？", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "此其一。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其二，中国不是一个放任型社会、不是应激式的制度设计，中国信奉的是选贤任能，然后高瞻远瞩、总体规划，采取的是对决策层开放一切治理工具的使用权。在这个基本政治哲学的原则里，只要能服务于战略目标，没有任何因素会去规定“某事不可做”、“某法不可立”。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这就意味着“不放弃”、“抓紧追赶”的战略判断会通过各种各样的政策制定、行政管理、经济宏观调控、市场机制……被自然的下发到社会的每一个层面，每一个角落，无形中使得拒绝担当应分角色的社会成员自动的蒙受机会成本的损失——这或者是以你丧失特定机会和资源的方式，或者是以奖励你的对手的方式，但结果都同样分明。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "每一个层面、每一个角落，意思是不管你是手作口吃，还是家财万贯、权位滔天，在整体战略里都安排了你的职责，都有为你准备的约束和规则，其实并没有谁有这种不受打扰的桃花源，可以置身事外，“无忧无虑”。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "换言之，在这场民族复兴/国家求存两面一体的历史进程中，没有人能自外，这是一个不以个人喜怒为转移的宏观的历史现实。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 789}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这甚至都不是决策层自己要无事生非，主动选择的，而是历史安排给中国这样一个特殊民族、特殊国家的天命。", "char_start": 790, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所谓天与弗取，反受其咎——天意要你坐这个位置，要坐上去要辛苦万分，坐上去了要痛苦万分，但你要贪懒不受，你要面对的会比这份辛苦和痛苦凶险万倍，甚至可能会不容你生存下去。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 923}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不吃敬酒，就要吃罚酒，根本没有“不喝”这个选项，给你的福利只有“主动喝敬酒的可以选喝什么牌子”而已。你要主动喝，你可以挑茅台，你满地打滚喊不喝，历史会拎着你的脖领子给你灌工业酒精兑白水，灌到你眼瞎ta都不会手软一软。", "char_start": 924, "char_end": 1032}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个大前提分清楚了，再看在公立教育上的具体问题。", "char_start": 1033, "char_end": 1057}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这个宏观现状，分解到班级一级，意味着教师从教育部和家长两个方面都会面对极其沉重的压力。这种压力和一个部门主管同时面对公司高层和客户两方面的压力没有本质的区别。", "char_start": 1058, "char_end": 1137}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果你把ta们的业绩目标量化，会发现这这个量化后的“业绩指标”的数字大得可怕。", "char_start": 1138, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "可以这么说——一个手腕圆熟、管理有效的班主任的才干门槛，绝不逊色于一名互联网大厂的经理。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1222}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你想想ta们那个工作内容的强度——ta们要管理30-70名心智尚未完全发育、社会化程度有限的个体，手上只有几个并不向ta们汇报、人事关系不由ta们决定的同僚。如果只是科目老师，那么连这有限的管理权也没有。", "char_start": 1223, "char_end": 1325}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你们部门的领导有直接管理50人，还全是行为不可测的、背后关系你得罪不起的新手吗？而且是每天开会，每天评价考核，每天安排任务这种强度？你们全公司有几个人在应付这个强度的工作？", "char_start": 1326, "char_end": 1412}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你设想一下，换了是你，你会不会用尽你一切正式和非正式的影响力去摊派、转授你的管理压力？换了你是ta的领导，你会不会默认允许ta们这样做？", "char_start": 1413, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这不是“家长有怨言”就能改变的安排，怨了也还是这样安排。因为这其实不是谁特别心理变态要凭空折腾谁，而是种种因素导致的别无选择，乃至于是已经尽量优化了之后的别无选择。", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1564}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你发泄完了，你还是要求加群的，不过你也可以放心——除非这个老师是个菜鸟新人，否则ta们早已见多了这种世态冷暖，对你根本没啥特别纠结的——这就像外科医生已经见多了ICU外崩溃的家属，不会把ta们的很多话放在心上一样。", "char_start": 1565, "char_end": 1672}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你道个歉，事情就过去了，太阳照常升起。", "char_start": 1673, "char_end": 1692}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "不道歉，不加回，也没人会来追究你、勉强你，你时间久了自己还是会扛不住的。", "char_start": 1693, "char_end": 1729}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "多来几次你会发现——其实这些“情绪爆发再修复”的过程本身很耗能。不折腾还轻松一些，折腾了到最后一算是纯损失，为难别人也为难自己，实属无谓。", "char_start": 1730, "char_end": 1799}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "几乎没人在故意跟你为难，只是在做历史的信使而已。", "char_start": 1800, "char_end": 1824}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "殴打信使，其实只是一种无聊的愚蠢行为。", "char_start": 1825, "char_end": 1844}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：江苏一家长认为家长群让家长承担了老师的工作，称「我就退出家长群怎么了」，为什么家长群会变成压力群？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“殴打信使”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个无解的时代问题，抱怨也没有多大用，抱怨发泄完了，后面还是要自己拉下面子求加回的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个无解的时代问题，抱怨也没有多大用，抱怨发泄完了，后面还是要自己拉下面子求加回的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "aae75ea2-76f2-551b-aefb-d47e5a4224e7", "source_ordinal": 2031, "reading_ordinal": 2025, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "效率之王", "published_at": "2023-09-06T03:44:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/620457299/answer/3198812546"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "同样的时间要你完成更多工作，你有两个选择：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "A）告诉ta完成不了，需要更多的时间，要更长的交期。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你的业余时间做什么副业跟企业是无关的，你有业余时间做自己的事，并不代表你的上班时间工作量不饱和。直接加更多工作量，你就问一下这些工作谁优先、谁滞后，然后要到更多时间即可。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这根本没有必要纠结。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "B）要求加工资。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "不管你是不是效率提高了，既然你完成了更多工作，你当然要获得更高报酬，这是理所当然的。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 197}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个要求你也可以引而不发，自己先做，经时间检验你真的可以完成而且确实完成了更多工作，你再提出要加工资。", "char_start": 198, "char_end": 249}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "ta不给，你就跳槽，让别家加给你。", "char_start": 250, "char_end": 267}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "工作业绩数据自己要留好，谁工作业绩数据好，谁自然说话大声。ta可以在下家面前说坏话、给差评，你把业绩数据往下家面前一摆——这是我一个月创造的产值，这是我要的薪水——让下家自己掂量要不要赚这份钱就好了。", "char_start": 268, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你放心，资本家都是很现实的，一个月处理四百万订单带来两百万净利润的人，哪怕你私下里杀人放火、殴打亲爹，ta们都会有人不介意，何况一个动机可疑的上家的碎碎念？", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这中间只有一个意外，就是你本来就确实效率很低，拿的工资就对不起你干的活，这时候上司给你加量你就没办法。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 499}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "说破天都没办法。", "char_start": 500, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "效率就是权力，利润就是爷。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 522}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "遇事不要问什么正义不正义、公平不公平，问你自己的效率，问利润。", "char_start": 523, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你有效率、有利润，你就有资格让别人去纠结公平不公平，你不需要纠结——你当然先拿，拿大份，而且是规则制定者，是坐庄的。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "哪有庄家天天喊不公平、不合理的。庄家只会头疼别人喊不公平、不合理。", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 647}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "有效率、有利润，你总有办法找到实现诉求的手段，世界上的一切都阻止不了你。", "char_start": 648, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "有钱不一定为所欲为——没有盈利能力的有钱人反正不敢花，跟没钱没有本质区别——但是如果你的利润增长之快超过了你的消费欲望，那简直就等于拥有无限的金钱，那是真的可以为所欲为。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "对方不服，你把公平的定义给ta改了都行。再不服，把ta踢出游戏。", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 803}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "一切解释权归效率方所有，谢谢。", "char_start": 804, "char_end": 819}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：领导知道我有自己的副业之后，开始给我加工作量，觉得我工作不饱和，该怎么办？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“效率之王”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“同样的时间要你完成更多工作，你有两个选择：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "同样的时间要你完成更多工作，你有两个选择：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "566f14ef-53d3-52f7-a203-dd79eb5ca2bf", "source_ordinal": 2030, "reading_ordinal": 2026, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "快改慢", "published_at": "2023-09-06T18:39:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/619960611/answer/3199856473"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "嘲讽中国的《治安管理条例》似乎是法律圈的一种普遍风气，但很少有人反思这样一个显而易见的事实——中国的治安秩序在全球世俗国家里是绝对领先的，可能仅次于一些沙利亚法管理的富裕小国家，远胜于美国和整本法律近乎照搬英美的大批国家和地区——胜于香港、台湾和几乎整个欧洲。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是个有大量统计数据甚至直接视频证据的、显而易见的、无法否定的、无法用巧妙的话术spin的事实。是几乎每一个亲身到访过中国的西方人——甚至是外国人——都能在第一时间确认的事实。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么问题来了——作为直接社会秩序的治安管理法，在理论上受到无穷的嘲笑，背着无数的罪名，但在实效上却超群绝伦，无可否认。", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "理论上“完美的”法律体系，搞得鸡飞狗跳零元购；理论上“落后而原始”的“恶法”却基本可以保证二十四小时单身出门吃烧烤。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个问题，要如何回答？", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这里先列出几个已经早就存在的答案来看看。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "解释A）中国在治安上得到好成绩是以在其他方面承受更大损失为代价的。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个意思是“算总账划不来”，是吧？也就是“这样设计你的车灯很亮但是轮子跑不快”的意思，不是吗？", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "那么，为什么这辆“灯亮轮不转”的蠢车，现在却好像变成了一台方程式压路机，在追着“灯不亮但轮飞转”的GTR们飞奔，把GTR们的后保险杠都撞掉了？", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "怎么可能出现本钱更小、现金流更差的企业反超本钱大上百倍、总体盈利而且更健康的企业这种反数学的事？反重力都可能存在，这种1*1% > 100*2%的反数学奇迹，必须得到解释吧？", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如何解释？", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "解释B）中国这种治安设计在总账上虽然存在净收益，但是如果不这么设计，净收益会比现在大得多。", "char_start": 621, "char_end": 666}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这个就不太好讲了，因为在没有办法调查平行宇宙的前提下，逻辑上没有手段来比较这两个版本的中国。而在现实中对比中国自身的两个阶段或者中国和一个所谓“类似中国的国家”几乎是没有意义的，因为完全没有办法控制其他变量，你也无法断言那些差别是可以忽略的，所以根本没有办法形成有效的对比。", "char_start": 667, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "但是，还是那句话——这意思是如果我们采用“理论更完美的方案”，我们就不是要花四十年才踩到西方的尾巴，而是只花三十年甚至二十年就可以。", "char_start": 805, "char_end": 871}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这不禁令人陷入沉思——你是不是对中华民族有点过度崇拜？四十年崛起已经是全人类历史上空前的经济狂飙了，增长的净规模超越了任何一个其他实体的同期增长，说得直白点，就是在这四十年里中国人民凭纯劳动创造的盈余比大英帝国当年用直接用掠夺所获得的盈余都大。而按照这个说法，这个速度可以再明显地快上一大截。", "char_start": 872, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你要知道这说的可是从人均不足初中学历，普遍连个手电筒都没有、十亿总人口的水平，用三十年压倒半个西方世界的总和的速度。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1077}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "也许这的确有可能——可能性这个东西是很难真的证明不存在的——但是，中国人可不可以也对“四十年赶上”这个成绩表示满意？", "char_start": 1078, "char_end": 1136}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "老实说，当一辆按你的理论无论如何都不该能跑得动、跑得远的车以你难以想象的速度追上甚至超过了你的时候，你不觉得继续万分笃定地嘲弄这辆车的“发动机原理落后”“设计拙劣”“不符合理论的规定”是一种问题吗？", "char_start": 1138, "char_end": 1237}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这就像坐在马车里眼睁睁看着火车超过去了的人在评价火车完全不像一辆完美的马车。", "char_start": 1238, "char_end": 1276}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "到底是快车要朝着慢车改，还是慢车该朝着快车改，这个问题为什么会对目睹了整个近现代史无数古兽尸骸的现代人成其为一个问题？", "char_start": 1277, "char_end": 1336}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：我国拟修订治安管理处罚法，具体信息如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“快改慢”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“嘲讽中国的《治安管理条例》似乎是法律圈的一种普遍风气，但很少有人反思这样一个显而易见的事实——中国的治安秩序在全球世俗国家里是绝对领先的，可能仅次于一些沙利亚法管理的富裕小国家，远胜于美国和整本法律近乎照搬英美的大批国家和地区——胜于香港、台湾和几乎整个欧洲。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "嘲讽中国的《治安管理条例》似乎是法律圈的一种普遍风气，但很少有人反思这样一个显而易见的事实——中国的治安秩序在全球世俗国家里是绝对领先的，可能仅次于一些沙利亚法管理的富裕小国家，远胜于美国和整本法律近乎照搬英美的大批国家和地区——胜于香港、台湾和几乎整个欧洲。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 130, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "731eb3ac-0eb6-5900-a661-3c4a37308366", "source_ordinal": 2029, "reading_ordinal": 2027, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "妖道", "published_at": "2023-09-06T21:26:53+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/609747330/answer/3200038153"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "人在“神迹”面前是非常脆弱的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这些人一般都是被一些“神迹”说服了。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你手里如果掌握着足够的科学知识和社会规律，留心处完全可以安排一些由你施展的“神迹”来对冲。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 80}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "举个例子，ta的大师父预言如何如何，你根据科学和社会规律知道结果必不如此，你最好的影响途径不是去跟ta们苦口婆心的讲公式、推逻辑、读论文、做实验，而是不加解释，直接抛出你的结论，让事实撞击信邪的人。", "char_start": 81, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“因为准确预言了日全食，土著人全族抛弃信了八百年的信仰奉其为神”的故事，你们难道没有听过吗？", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 227}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "ta呼风，你能唤雨，当然你是圣僧；柜子打开不是小道士而是小和尚，ta当然就是妖道。", "char_start": 228, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "“破除迷信”效率最高的办法，是直接在西北道上指力对指力，破了ta的龙爪手、割了ta的首级。", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "神迹对神迹，不要“讲道理”。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "信仰不是说服来的，信仰是征服来的。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 348}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你自己就不是被理论说服的，你其实是被实验征服的。", "char_start": 349, "char_end": 373}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 10}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：信佛被洗脑的人，怎么让她恢复正常？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010"], "summary": "围绕“妖道”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“人在“神迹”面前是非常脆弱的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "人在“神迹”面前是非常脆弱的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "49002658-43e9-50ec-a69f-48d0f11570f8", "source_ordinal": 2028, "reading_ordinal": 2028, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "饿死", "published_at": "2023-09-06T22:34:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/620484340/answer/3200115845"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "具体而言，这是人对饥饿的凶险缺少警惕造成的一次事故。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "很多现代人都以为饥饿只是一种不适的感觉，以为只要自己对这个感觉足够适应、足够忍耐，那么饥饿要致命需要很漫长的时间。", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "而在这漫长的进行性过程里，自己只需要迈几步甚至一伸手拉开冰箱门就能逆转这个过程。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 125}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "所以这就成了一种安全的危险，很像“被一只致命的蜗牛追杀”——这蜗牛只要保持接触十秒就会致命，但却时速八厘米，于是它就成了一件奇妙的法宝——它能赋予你“被追杀者”的传奇属性，让你不再是一个凡人，但却“不会真的给你带来实际危险”。", "char_start": 126, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "殊不知，饥饿是一种平稳下滑到越过临界点后瞬间就会致命的危险——一旦你的肌体缺乏某个必要的营养素到越过了最低极限，你就会瞬间丧失一切反抗自救的机会。", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 313}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "前一刻你还觉得可以翻个身起来去楼下买个鸡腿，何妨继续享受一下这种超凡脱俗的修行感，下一刻你意外的发现你翻不了身了。", "char_start": 314, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不但翻不了身，也喊不出声。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "也睁不开眼。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "巨大的恐惧是出现了，但也不再能有效刺激肾上腺素分泌，提升心跳和血压。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这时离你真正死亡还有几个小时，但你却已经丧失了全部的行动能力和感知能力，跨过了临界点，走向了无限衰竭的单向过程。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 484}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这期间除非有人从外部发现和施救，否则你本人已经完全无能为力了。", "char_start": 485, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而这个致命节点的发生时间，远早于自以为对饥饿经验丰富的你的预料。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "恰恰是你饥饿太久，“经验丰富”，你才会犯下这个错误。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "就像喜欢寒冷刺激的人一样，在最后一刻都是信心满满、自认为安全可控的，甚至还觉得酒精让全身暖洋洋的，热到要脱衣服，但是一旦越过了特定生理极限，人就瞬间失能了，只会在第二天早上成为微笑的冰块。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这些人犯了一个致命的逻辑错误——那就是ta们只有饥饿/寒冷的经验，其实没有饥饿/寒冷过头的经验。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "连一次也没有。", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "ta们只是凭着饥饿/寒冷的经验以为曲线下降的斜率是稳定的，所以断定再下降一点的后果仅仅是感受线性的增强一点。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 783}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "却没有料到下降曲线是不连续的，再往前一步就是悬崖。", "char_start": 784, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "而ta们之所以会犯下这个错误，还因为这种痛苦之中有存在性的快感。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 842}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为ta们已经上了饥寒的瘾。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 857}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0301"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：Akid（王懿）怎么会饿死的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“饿死”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“具体而言，这是人对饥饿的凶险缺少警惕造成的一次事故。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "具体而言，这是人对饥饿的凶险缺少警惕造成的一次事故。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 26, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
